<script type="application/json">{"nodes": [{"id": "record", "label": "Work record"}, {"id": "system", "label": "System scheduler"}, {"id": "worker", "label": "CoroutineWorker"}], "layouts": {"wide": {"size": [760, 260], "nodes": {"record": {"x": 24, "y": 64, "w": 208, "h": 88}, "system": {"x": 276, "y": 64, "w": 208, "h": 88}, "worker": {"x": 528, "y": 64, "w": 208, "h": 88}}, "edges": {"schedule": "M234 86 L274 86", "start": "M486 86 L526 86", "result": "M632 154 C632 224 128 224 128 154"}, "labels": []}, "narrow": {"size": [320, 500], "nodes": {"record": {"x": 40, "y": 26, "w": 240, "h": 88}, "system": {"x": 40, "y": 182, "w": 240, "h": 88}, "worker": {"x": 40, "y": 338, "w": 240, "h": 88}}, "edges": {"schedule": "M120 116 L120 180", "start": "M120 272 L120 336", "result": "M282 382 C312 382 312 70 282 70"}, "labels": [], "pk": {"dx": 10, "dy": 5, "anchor": "start"}}}, "modes": {"run": {"initial": {"nodes": {"record": ["", "not enqueued"], "system": ["", "no request"], "worker": ["", "not running"]}}, "steps": [{"caption": "enqueueUniqueWork records one request with an unmetered-network constraint. In this run there is only metered connectivity, so it remains ENQUEUED.", "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-done", "ENQUEUED"]}}}, {"caption": "WorkManager arranges scheduling for the persisted request. Registration is not proof that a worker has started.", "packets": [{"edge": "schedule", "label": "schedule", "tone": "fwd"}], "set": {"nodes": {"system": ["is-warn", "waiting for constraints"]}}}, {"caption": "The process dies and the device later reboots. Pending work is persisted and rescheduled; persistence supplies no exact execution deadline.", "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-done", "still persisted"], "system": ["is-warn", "pending after reboot"]}}}, {"caption": "Later, all constraints hold and the system grants an execution opportunity. WorkManager starts this CoroutineWorker; the work becomes RUNNING.", "packets": [{"edge": "start", "label": "start", "tone": "fwd"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-active", "RUNNING"], "system": ["is-done", "execution allowed"], "worker": ["is-active", "sync attempt"]}}}, {"caption": "The attempt returns Result.retry(). The work returns to ENQUEUED with its configured backoff. The paused interval is waiting, not activity between boxes.", "packets": [{"edge": "result", "label": "retry", "tone": "back"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-warn", "ENQUEUED · backoff"], "worker": ["is-warn", "retry requested"]}}}, {"caption": "Once eligible again, a later opportunity starts another attempt. Retried writes need idempotency; a failed attempt may already have reached the server.", "packets": [{"edge": "start", "label": "start", "tone": "fwd"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-active", "RUNNING"], "worker": ["is-active", "next attempt"]}}}, {"caption": "This attempt returns Result.success(). The record becomes SUCCEEDED. If constraints become unmet during a run, WorkManager stops the worker and retries when they hold again.", "packets": [{"edge": "result", "label": "success", "tone": "back"}], "set": {"nodes": {"record": ["is-done", "SUCCEEDED"], "worker": ["is-done", "success"]}}}]}}}</script>
<p class="pb-sub">Sources: <a href="https://developer.android.com/develop/background-work/background-tasks/persistent/getting-started/define-work">Work requests, constraints and retry</a>.</p>
